 the repetition of a word or words in the same sense but in a different
 application; it is thus defined and illustrated by Mammaṭa:-- {#SAbdastu#}
 {#lAwAnuprAso Bede tAtparyamAtrataH#}, {%<ab>e. g.</ab>%} {#vadanaM varavarRinyAstasyAH#}
